**Standard Error (SD of the Null‑Hypothesis Test)**  

\[
\sigma_{\text{H}_0}= \frac{s}{\sqrt{n}}
                  = \frac{1.4}{\sqrt{40}}
                  \approx \frac{1.4}{6.3249}
                  \approx 0.222
\]

Rounded to three decimal places:

\[
\boxed{\sigma_{\text{H}_0}\;\approx\;0.222}
\]
